{title: Tobu Jodi Tumi Ashte Chao}
{artist: Rupankar}
{key: A}

{c: Verse 1}
[A] Tobu [C#m] jodi tumi ashte [Bm] chao,        [E] Khola ache amar [A] duhat
[A] Jeno [C#m] ekhane nei kono [Bm] hisheb,        [E] Shudhu ache nil [A] akash
[A] Ache lagam chera swapno buker [C#m] vetor,        [Bm] Ache beporowa botam bihin [E] shirt
[A] Ache hariye jawar nesha nake [C#m] mukhe,        [Bm] Bhule giye rojkar dokan bajar [E] hat
Ache [A] rasta ekta [C#m] cholar,        ache [Bm] onek kotha [E] bolar
[A] Ache pocket kintu [D] pocket gorer [E] math,        [A] Tobu [C#m] jodi tumi ashte [Bm] chao
[E] Khola ache amar [A] duhat,        [A] Jeno [C#m] ekhane nei kono [Bm] hisheb
[E] Shudhu ache nil [A] akash,        [A] Bhalo [C#m] jodi tumi bashte [Bm] chao
[E] nijeke aj nijer [A] moto,        [A] Fele [C#m] rekhe diye pi [Bm] chutan
[E] chole esho..chole [A] esho......        [A] Nei ekhane bhobisshoter [C#m] bhabna
[Bm] Nei kono samporker dabi [E] dawa,        [A] Shudu shukh dukher e shorik hote [C#m] pari
[Bm] Nei onno kono chawa [E] pawa,        Shudhu [A] rasta ache [C#m] cholar ache
[Bm] sotti kotha [E] bolar,        [A] Ache pocket kintu [D] pocket gorer [E] math
[A] Tobu [C#m] jodi tumi ashte [Bm] chao,        [E] Khola ache amar [A] duhat
[A] Jeno [C#m] ekhane nei kono [Bm] hisheb,        [E] Shudhu ache nil [A] akash
[A] Bhalo [C#m] jodi tumi bashte [Bm] chao,        [E] nijeke aj nijer [A] moto
[A] Fele [C#m] rekhe diye pi [Bm] chutan,        [E] chole esho..chole [A] esho......
